stateDiagram-v2
  accTitle: Transport status
  accDescr: No ride goes to DISPATCHED. DISPATCHED goes to PICKED_UP, ARRIVED or FAILED. PICKED_UP goes to ARRIVED or FAILED. FAILED can be dispatched again.
  [*] --> NO_RIDE
  NO_RIDE --> DISPATCHED: Dispatch van
  DISPATCHED --> PICKED_UP: Driver picks up
  DISPATCHED --> ARRIVED: Confirm arrival
  PICKED_UP --> ARRIVED: Confirm arrival
  DISPATCHED --> FAILED: Report problem
  PICKED_UP --> FAILED: Report problem
  FAILED --> DISPATCHED: Dispatch again
  ARRIVED --> [*]
